# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# v1.0.78, opened by scripts/new_cut.sh from v1.0.77.
#
# WHY THESE PINS:
#   v1.0.78 carries the SAME payload as v1.0.77 past a gate that could not 
#   measure it. install.sh is byte-identical: blob 
#   3c41f39273f9afdfe7d61bc343e4e4357e8a163f at the old pin 9e380700 and at 
#   f5bbd436, compared by blob rather than ancestry. v1.0.77 built nothing -- 
#   it refused at preflight step 9 with exit 2, CANNOT-RUN, because its only 
#   BOM row (CM051#1835, the first-install port deadlock) ships by DELETING 
#   lines from install.sh and the gate keyed presence only. CM051 #1841 makes 
#   a removal measurable by asserting the deleted line is ABSENT from the 
#   pinned blob, and adds a test deriving cut.yml's gate list so new_cut.sh 
#   cannot print ALL GREEN while a hard preflight gate is missing from its 
#   own list. DAEMON_COMMIT is unchanged at e3ddf5de (hub-v0.4.75, tarball 
